              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi akakho othela iwayini elisha ezimvabeni ezindala, funa iwayini liqhumise izimvaba, lichitheke iwayini, nezimvaba zonakale; kodwa iwayini elisha lithelwa ezimvabeni ezintsha.”",
          "type": "text",
